            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, all our drivers speak basic English and are familiar with hotel landmarks in Varanasi."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I request a female driver?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Female drivers are available on request with 48-hour advance notice."
